  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reportages by Ukrainian Writers on Ukraine&apos;s War for Independence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s main objectives are to strengthen the social impact of Reporters as the main Ukrainian literary reportage media by the creation of 6 reportages on Ukraine&apos;s war for independence by famous Ukrainian writers. All six will also be professionally translated into English. The project target group is proactive urban youth, journalists, writers.</narrative>
  </description>
